1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 21=

10
00:01:02,190 --> 00:01:04,910
I have nothing more to say.

11
00:01:05,990 --> 00:01:06,910
I ask only for death.

12
00:01:10,390 --> 00:01:13,590
Do you really think I won't kill you?

13
00:01:32,540 --> 00:01:33,070
Lock her up.

14
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:36,460
Without my orders,

15
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:39,220
she is not to take
a single step outside the room.

16
00:01:41,750 --> 00:01:42,470
Yes, General.

17
00:01:46,030 --> 00:01:46,500
Get out.

18
00:01:54,690 --> 00:01:55,220
Light it.

19
00:02:18,590 --> 00:02:19,230
We did it.

20
00:02:19,390 --> 00:02:19,900
Master.

21
00:02:20,230 --> 00:02:20,900
We did it!

22
00:02:30,230 --> 00:02:30,700
Master.

23
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:34,180
There's been no word
from Mei Jiu for days.

24
00:02:34,870 --> 00:02:35,870
Do you think something happened to her?

25
00:02:45,830 --> 00:02:46,540
At the Hour of the Chen,

26
00:02:48,310 --> 00:02:49,870
release the poison soldiers
into the city.

27
00:02:50,340 --> 00:02:52,180
But...

28
00:02:53,310 --> 00:02:53,780
General.

29
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,180
The people in this city

30
00:02:55,470 --> 00:02:56,420
are all innocent civilians.

31
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:04,510
Our army has guarded the frontier

32
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:06,510
against countless enemy invasions.

33
00:03:06,670 --> 00:03:07,460
Of all the battles we've won,

34
00:03:07,510 --> 00:03:09,190
which one wasn't bought
with our soldiers' lives?

35
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:13,070
I created the poison soldiers

36
00:03:14,110 --> 00:03:15,300
to protect the peace of our nation.

37
00:03:15,300 --> 00:03:16,260
What have I done wrong?

38
00:03:19,460 --> 00:03:20,350
But what did the Emperor do?

39
00:03:20,790 --> 00:03:22,020
He discarded us
once we had served our purpose.

40
00:03:25,230 --> 00:03:26,420
Since he showed me no mercy,

41
00:03:28,190 --> 00:03:30,110
he cannot blame me
for turning against him.

42
00:03:36,190 --> 00:03:37,830
I want future generations to know

43
00:03:39,390 --> 00:03:40,300
who it was

44
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:42,670
that drove a loyal subject to rebellion,

45
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:43,700
and who it was

46
00:03:46,190 --> 00:03:47,510
that brought this realm to ruin.

47
00:03:51,420 --> 00:03:52,230
Yes, General.

48
00:04:06,630 --> 00:04:07,300
The General has given his orders.

49
00:04:07,830 --> 00:04:08,540
Tomorrow at the Hour of the Chen,

50
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:10,070
release the poison soldiers
into the city.

51
00:04:10,460 --> 00:04:11,190
Make preparations at once.

52
00:04:11,510 --> 00:04:12,260
Yes, sir.

53
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:31,110
(Strange.)

54
00:04:32,140 --> 00:04:33,510
(Why isn't there anyone in the city?)

55
00:04:43,510 --> 00:04:44,980
Where exactly are you taking me?

56
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:47,350
To the ends of the earth.

57
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:50,510
Wherever I am,

58
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:52,910
that is where you belong.

59
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:02,740
You still dare try
to send word to your master?

60
00:05:04,350 --> 00:05:06,390
Even if that emperor were here,

61
00:05:07,420 --> 00:05:08,700
he couldn't save you.

62
00:05:09,510 --> 00:05:10,790
Take one more step,

63
00:05:12,020 --> 00:05:13,140
and two lives will be lost.

64
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:17,700
Xiao Jing!

65
00:05:21,990 --> 00:05:22,990
Get out here!

66
00:05:40,870 --> 00:05:41,830
(Young Master?)

67
00:05:50,750 --> 00:05:52,520
So it was you, you worthless coward.

68
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:17,830
Get ready.

69
00:06:18,950 --> 00:06:19,460
Light it.

70
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:22,070
Fire!

71
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:25,100
Fire!

72
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:27,190
Fire!

73
00:06:33,310 --> 00:06:34,660
Seize him!

74
00:06:50,460 --> 00:06:51,020
Xiao Jing.

75
00:06:52,750 --> 00:06:53,580
Stop this.

76
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:02,550
So you're one of his men.

77
00:07:41,580 --> 00:07:42,990
You think having the same mark as mine

78
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:45,630
will earn you Father's approval?

79
00:07:46,310 --> 00:07:46,900
Dream on.

80
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:48,140
Dream on!

81
00:08:30,830 --> 00:08:31,220
Don't move.

82
00:08:37,190 --> 00:08:37,750
Haitang.

83
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:43,260
If I must lose to you,

84
00:08:48,510 --> 00:08:50,340
I accept it gladly.

85
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:54,990
Go.

86
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:02,700
(Xiao Jing, you lost.)

87
00:09:03,370 --> 00:09:04,280
(Young Master.)

88
00:09:05,550 --> 00:09:08,550
(I will never die by your hand.)

89
00:09:28,430 --> 00:09:29,220
My dear,

90
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:43,220
take our child

91
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:46,550
and live well.

92
00:09:47,980 --> 00:09:49,220
Tell him

93
00:09:49,910 --> 00:09:51,100
that his father

94
00:09:54,100 --> 00:09:55,100
was

95
00:09:55,620 --> 00:09:58,700
an undefeated

96
00:10:00,270 --> 00:10:01,380
great general.

97
00:10:13,740 --> 00:10:14,670
(Father.)

98
00:10:15,550 --> 00:10:16,310
(Mother.)

99
00:10:17,460 --> 00:10:18,150
(Brother.)

100
00:10:20,670 --> 00:10:21,950
(The blood debt
owed to the Shen family...)

101
00:10:23,270 --> 00:10:24,380
(Today, I)

102
00:10:26,190 --> 00:10:27,830
(have finally avenged it.)

103
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:33,860
Please, there's no need
to see me any farther.

104
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:34,740
Mei Jiu.

105
00:10:35,270 --> 00:10:36,270
Must you really leave?

106
00:10:37,150 --> 00:10:38,100
Why not stay?

107
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:40,550
Mei Qi and I have repaid

108
00:10:40,980 --> 00:10:42,150
the kindness Young Master showed us.

109
00:10:42,830 --> 00:10:43,790
From now on,

110
00:10:44,380 --> 00:10:45,270
I want to choose my own path.

111
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:47,340
But where can you go now?

112
00:10:48,190 --> 00:10:49,150
You're all alone,

113
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:50,150
and you're carrying a child.

114
00:10:50,430 --> 00:10:51,950
How can we not worry about you?

115
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:56,580
It's precisely
because I'm carrying his child

116
00:10:57,150 --> 00:10:58,340
that I must leave this place.

117
00:10:59,070 --> 00:11:00,620
I want my child
to grow up far from conflict,

118
00:11:01,030 --> 00:11:01,950
free to go wherever life takes us.

119
00:11:08,910 --> 00:11:10,150
Whatever lies ahead,

120
00:11:11,340 --> 00:11:13,220
I hope you'll live well

121
00:11:14,150 --> 00:11:15,070
for the one you love.

122
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:21,700
Since you've made up your mind,

123
00:11:23,150 --> 00:11:24,340
I won't try to persuade you further.

124
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:29,310
Take care on your journey.

125
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:31,860
No matter when or where,

126
00:11:32,150 --> 00:11:33,030
if you ever need anything,

127
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:34,270
send word at any time.

128
00:11:37,190 --> 00:11:37,860
Take care.

129
00:11:56,620 --> 00:12:00,790
I can never repay Mei Qi and Mei Jiu

130
00:12:03,070 --> 00:12:04,030
for protecting me with their lives.

131
00:12:06,550 --> 00:12:07,380
Living well

132
00:12:08,980 --> 00:12:10,670
is the best way to repay them.

133
00:12:16,700 --> 00:12:17,220
Let's go.

134
00:12:17,700 --> 00:12:18,030
All right.

135
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:22,550
- Stop!
- Don't run!

136
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:43,340
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

137
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:47,040
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

138
00:12:47,700 --> 00:12:50,520
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

139
00:12:51,370 --> 00:12:54,360
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

140
00:12:55,210 --> 00:12:58,530
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

141
00:12:58,870 --> 00:13:02,160
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

142
00:13:02,510 --> 00:13:08,990
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

143
00:13:09,780 --> 00:13:16,870
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

144
00:13:19,370 --> 00:13:27,220
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

145
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:29,330
♪I stand here today♪

146
00:13:29,470 --> 00:13:33,980
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

147
00:13:33,980 --> 00:13:41,470
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

148
00:13:42,110 --> 00:13:43,400
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

149
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:45,800
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

150
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:53,090
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
